exit: 1
-- CAPABILITY --------------- errors/cap_mismatch_2.march

`greet` needs console access, but `cap` is the full IO capability. [cap_mismatch]

13 |     greet(cap, "march")
               ^^^

    `IO` contains `IO.Console`, but a capability is never narrowed implicitly.
    help: pass `cap_narrow(cap)`, which narrows it to `Cap(IO.Console)`.

    `greet` needs `Cap(IO.Console)`:

13 |     greet(cap, "march")
         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

    `cap` was bound here as `Cap(IO)`:

12 |   fn main(cap : Cap(IO)) do
               ^^^

    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

13 -     greet(cap, "march")
13 +     greet(cap_narrow(cap), "march")



after fix: exit 0
